    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The M-97 Viper is a semi-automatic sniper rifle built for sustained precision fire. Where bolt-action rifles demand patience between shots, the Viper allows follow-up strikes without breaking scope alignment. Its heat sink holds twelve rounds before requiring a swap, enabling snipers to handle multiple targets at range without repositioning. The trade-off is a somewhat lighter kinetic impact per shot compared to the Mantis.</p>"
